{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Trust Under Fire</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb together or fall as one. SunderBound is a 2-player co-op top-down shooter with roguelite progression and tactical elements, set in a decaying dieselpunk world shattered by a failed weather weapon. With tech fried and time short, all that\u2019s left is the climb one brutal floor at a time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as two rebels fighting their way through Haven: a dystopian mega-structure ruled by a godlike tyrant known only as The Minister. Each level hits differently, throws harder enemies, deadlier traps, and pushes tougher decisions. Whether you team up with a friend or roll solo with a smart companion, you\u2019ll need to cover each other, sync perks, and time every push to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You\u2019re here to survive the world. And maybe, break it a little on the way up.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Built for Two</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SunderBound thrives on cooperation. Every fight, every revive, every clutch decision is tuned for two. Play side by side in couch co-op, team up online, or go solo with an AI companion who becomes your shadow, matches your pace, and listens to your commands.\u00a0 However you play, it\u2019s teamwork all the way up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/ece40ab7460ea46ab1841bab091353f0.poster.avif?t=1769786106\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/ece40ab7460ea46ab1841bab091353f0.webm?t=1769786106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.avif?t=1769786106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras_big/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.webp?t=1769786106 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Grounded Gunplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat in SunderBound is controlled chaos. Cover counts. Timing your rounds could be the difference between death and success. Lock in class combos, split flanks, and execute your pushes with precision. Every room\u2019s a pressure test. If you panic, you\u2019re done. Plan it right, and you make it look easy</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/84b6201dada334c5dc16cc53d7ef07c0.poster.avif?t=1769786106\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/84b6201dada334c5dc16cc53d7ef07c0.webm?t=1769786106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.avif?t=1769786106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras_big/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.webp?t=1769786106 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Every Floor, a Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each mission is a brutal climb, a shifting sequence of procedurally generated floors packed with ambushes, enemy waves, and high-stakes boss battles. No two missions play exactly the same, with different paths, enemy spawns, and gameplay-changing perks. Learn fast. Push harder. Climb smarter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/0b004b558aec73593e641c77b8e29a2a.poster.avif?t=1769786106\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/0b004b558aec73593e641c77b8e29a2a.webm?t=1769786106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.avif?t=1769786106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras_big/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.webp?t=1769786106 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Define your PlayStyle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your characters and build your loadout your way: earn, buy, or craft gear that fits you. Weapons, perks, and augments sharpen your build with every step. Create synergies with your teammate, opening new tactical possibilities. It\u2019s progression with purpose, every upgrade adds impact, precision and momentum.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/99d32f1f848b02e07f6a90240f6735ad.poster.avif?t=1769786106\" width=780 height=250 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/99d32f1f848b02e07f6a90240f6735ad.webm?t=1769786106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.avif?t=1769786106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras_big/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.webp?t=1769786106 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Broken World That Bleeds Style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget chrome and clean lines. This tower is brutalist, broken, and boiling with tension. Cracked concrete, busted wiring, and flickering warnings paint every floor. You\u2019ll push through steam-choked factories, collapsed medical bays, and decayed corporate labs. It\u2019s gritty, dense, and worn in the best way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/3f0c701604f36c3e1df0ddca2fccd7fa.poster.avif?t=1769786106\" width=780 height=420 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/3f0c701604f36c3e1df0ddca2fccd7fa.webm?t=1769786106\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.avif?t=1769786106\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/extras_big/70083844fd3d879813f7d127f1ea28ad.webp?t=1769786106 width=1560 height=177 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1477750?t=1769786106","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1477750?t=1769786106","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1477750/5e84be2e1146079b18d7e85b0856dfa919b41096/c